[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、あたしたちはちょっと寄る所があるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've got somewhere to stop by first."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。じゃあ、また明日！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Then we'll see you tomorrow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ばいばーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "See ya later!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういうことなんだ、このー！\u3000ドッキリかー？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's going on here?! Is this some kind of prank?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、違うよ。本当に偶然、ユナさんに声を\nかけられただけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, no, nothing like that. It really was just a coincidence that Juna approached me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、ランターナ学園と言えば、ライザが目指してた\n学校だっていうのは覚えてた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I remembered that Lantarna Academy was the school you were aiming for."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、また会えるかなって来てみたんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I thought we could meet again if I came enrolled."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "久しぶり、ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's been a while, Ryza."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしも会いたかった！\u3000クラウディア、\n急に引っ越しちゃうんだもん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I missed you so much! You just up and moved away all of a sudden!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい。また急な親の仕事の都合で……ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm sorry. My parents' work situation changed suddenly again..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当は離れたくなかった。\nだから、また一緒になれて本当に嬉しい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I really didn't want to leave. That's why I'm truly happy we can be together again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしもだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]